  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Programme Formulation KAIPTC, Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the appraisal is to provide an assessment of the projects documents and quality assurance of the main documents (including annexes) in accordance with &#x201c;Danida Guidelines for Programmes and Projects above DKK 10 Mio. (January 2018)&#x201d;     
The purpose of the appraisal is to provide quality assurance check of the programme documents, and the underlying relevant documentation for the proposed support to KAIPTC. The recommendations from the appraisal will feed into finalisation of the programme documents. Further, the appraisal will provide inputs and comments on the areas of special interest for Denmark and possible cooperation with KAIPTC during the implementation stage.</narrative>
  </description>
